  "instructions": [
    "Cook the egg noodles according to the package instructions and set aside.",
    "In a large pan, heat the vegetable oil over medium heat and add the sliced onion.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the chilli powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the coconut milk, soy sauce, and brown sugar, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the grilled tofu and bean sprouts, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the pan and stir to combine with the sauce.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring constantly, and serve hot."
